  notes: >-
    arXiv:2608.16436. Versions 1 and 2 were titled "Dynamical spectral functions from bitstring-sampled
    quantum subspaces: entanglement, not one-body magic, tracks the sampling cost"; in version 3 the
    weight-only bound of those versions (Theorem 1(iii)), which does not hold, is replaced by a proved
    two-sided leakage bound, and the paper is retitled accordingly. Deposit 3.4.0 carries the revised
    manuscript prepared for Physical Review A (2026-09-30). The version and release date
    above describe THIS deposit, not the arXiv posting date.
